        "Content": "End of terrace four bedroom house.\r\nRequires refurbishment.\r\nSpacious and well proportioned accommodation.\r\nSought after North Dublin suburb convenient to a host of amenities.\r\nWell serviced by public transport links with Clongriffin DART station within walking distance as well as multiple Dublin bus routes.\r\nExtending to approximately 189 sq. m (2,034 sq. ft).\r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nThis property provides an end of terrace four bedroom house with small yard to the rear. The property is arranged over ground and two upper floors beneath a pitched roof. This property offers off street parking. We are informed the property extends to approximately 189 sq. m (2,034 sq. ft).\r\n\r\nVacant Possession."
